# Context protocol

```
MASTER_PROMPT.md
PRD.md              once per session, never again
PROJECT_STATE.md
TASK.md
ARCHITECTURE.md     only if the task changes structure
```

Then: code → test → update `PROJECT_STATE.md` → STOP.

`AGENTS.md` is the index. Do not hunt for another spec. Do not reread the full PRD after the first pass.

## Do not

- Improve the whole project. Do only `TASK.md`.
- Search parent folders, OneDrive, Claude Projects, `.claude`, or Task Master
- Read `node_modules/**`, `.next/**`, lockfiles, or all of `data/sources.json` unless the task edits seeds
- Build newsroom, AI, scrapers, scheduler, auth, or a database unless `TASK.md` says so

## Do

- If `TASK.md` is `idle`, stop and wait
- Prefer `Grep` / targeted `Read`
- Reuse files already read in this chat

```text
❌ BAD: reread PRD.md, then wander the repo
✅ GOOD: MASTER → STATE → TASK → one code file
```
